# An example scenario. `chrome-cdp test` runs every file in e2e/scenarios.
# Each step is a chrome-cdp command as typed after `chrome-cdp`; a URL
# path is relative to base_url in chrome-cdp.toml. The mock set "base"
# (e2e/mocks/base.toml) answers the app's API calls in every test.

@test "the home page loads without errors"
  goto /
  expect 'css=body' visible
  expect --no-errors
